由です、フリー。\n用途としましては個人的な使用とSNS上でのみてみてくらいかと思います。\n完成した絵をそーせ氏がいかように使うのも大丈夫です、みんなしあわせ。\n\n\nそんなわけでこれでいいならよろしくおねがいします！！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@souse/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/5bee4407/uploads/origins/8cee78a6-df27-420d-a66a-c9a18a5c3287?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f5d6e5cbc57c6a6d0d39274d8229678a", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5bee4407/uploads/origins/8cee78a6-df27-420d-a66a-c9a18a5c3287?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f5d6e5cbc57c6a6d0d39274d8229678a, https://si.imgix.net/5bee4407/uploads/origins/8cee78a6-df27-420d-a66a-c9a18a5c3287?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=663ba5df0f08c34435f086094959e5a7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5bee4407/uploads/origins/8cee78a6-df27-420d-a66a-c9a18a5c3287?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c2a1b9e44ba27db01c2adb53d7b6a538 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "白ビキニは清楚\n\nhttps://twitter.com/kojiro_twice/status/1276521726197694464", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@souse/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/99e127d9/uploads/origins/13482f3e-477e-4d2a-8424-827369f68722?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bbf75db13ed49201a383ea071769bdb5", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/99e127d9/uploads/origins/13482f3e-477e-4d2a-8424-827369f68722?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bbf75db13ed49201a383ea071769bdb5, https://si.imgix.net/99e127d9/uploads/origins/13482f3e-477e-4d2a-8424-827369f68722?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=85caeb437752c6d63381d2d6b6b22eeb 2x, https://si.imgix.net/99e127d9/uploads/origins/13482f3e-477e-4d2a-8424-827369f68722?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ff0f993d506aee4500678855fa5c9006 3x",